Access control
--------------
Authorized admin workstations : nginx/admin-acl.inc
Barred workstations           : nginx/blocked-hosts.inc
                                (enforced in nginx, proxy/site-stats.mjs, sshd,
                                and nftables via customsh/lockdown/apply-lockdown.sh)
Deploy provenance             : every $SITEUPDATE run writes a sha256 manifest
                                of out/ to /mnt/storage/logs/apen-deploy-manifests/;
                                scripts/verify-deploy.sh checks the live tree
                                against it.

